OL,3,AStruggling households need more help
OL,4,Awith bills, energy industry says
OL,5,
OL,6,FHigher energy bills this winter mean
OL,7,Fthe government should step in to
OL,8,Fprovide more help for households most
OL,9,Fin need, the body representing energy
OL,10,Ffirms in the UK has said.
OL,12,FStubbornly high prices over the last
OL,13,Ffew years have left some people needing
OL,14,F"emergency support" over and above the
OL,15,Fexisting #150 Warm Home Discount,
OL,16,FEnergy UK said.
OL,18,FIt added that bills were unaffordable
OL,19,Ffor millions and a "better targeted and
OL,20,Fmore agile" support scheme was needed.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
